 h_L_one : S_L * star S_L \u003d S_L * 1 * star S_L :\u003d by ring\n  have h_R_one : S_R * star S_R \u003d S_R * 1 * star S_R :\u003d by ring\n  \n  have h_L_scale : φ (S_L * star S_L) \u003d p * φ 1 :\u003d by\n    rw [h_L_one]\n    exact h_kms.kms_L 1\n    \n  have h_R_scale : φ (S_R * star S_R) \u003d p * φ 1 :\u003d by\n    rw [h_R_one]\n    exact h_kms.kms_R 1\n    \n  -- Substitute everything into the partition of unity\n  rw [h_add, h_L_scale, h_R_scale, φ.map_one] at h_unity\n  -- Now we have: p * 1 + p * 1 \u003d 1\n  -- Which is: p + p \u003d 1 ⇒ 2 * p \u003d 1 ⇒ p \u003d 1 / 2.\n  have h_two_p : 2 * p \u003d 1 :\u003d by\n    calc\n      2 * p \u003d p * 1 + p * 1 :\u003d by ring\n      _ \u003d 1 :\u003d h_unity\n      \n  -- Now divide by 2 to isolate p\n  have h_div : p \u003d 1 / 2 :\u003d by\n    calc\n      p \u003d (2 * p) * (1 / 2 : ℂ) :\u003d by ring\n      _ \u003d 1 * (1 / 2 : ℂ) :\u003d by rw [h_two_p]\n      _ \u003d 1 / 2 :\u003d by ring\n      \n  exact h_div\n\nend InfoGeometry.Analysis.JaynesRelativeStates\n```\n\n---\n\n### Physical and Information-Theoretic Consequences\n1.  **Symmetry Restoration:** The vacuum states of the Cuntz tree ($\\varphi_L$ and $\\varphi_R$) break left-right exchange symmetry. They are highly polarized \"relative states\" representing extreme informational boundaries.\n2.  **KMS State as the MaxEnt State:** By enforcing the absence of information bias (MaxEnt, $p_L \u003d p_R$), the state naturally transitions from a pure, broken-symmetry state of Type I to the unique, symmetric factor state of Type $\\text{III}_1$.\n3.  **The Information Budget:** This proof demonstrates that the $1/2$ scaling factor is the exact mathematical partition of the unit information budget ($1$) across the two equivalent branches of the Cantor set. This connects the thermodynamic KMS condition directly to standard Bayesian reasoning on binary trees.",
